On which graphics device?  You can do it on postscript() via Alan 
Zaslavsky's postscriptfonts package: see MASS4, p.82 for an example.

Greek letters are not part of ISO Latin-1 and I think you are going to 
have to use the symbol font to use them.  OTOH, AFAIK font=13 is the 
symbol font in the postscript() device and not elsewhere.

