Hi, All: 

I had to call Splus technical service to find the answer. One of my
colleague told me that he also posted a similar question a while ago,
but didn't get an easy answer. Here are the steps.

1. Get rid of the label on the particular axis.

2. Select 'Insert', and 'Text' to enter text characters. While you are
still in the text box, select 'Insert', and 'Symbol' to add symbol. 

3. Move the text box to wherever you need to place them. 

4. If you need to rotate the box, simply click on the 'round' green
knob outside of the text box. Note that most of the green knob are
'square', only one on the middle of the bottom knobs is a round one. 

Helen

