fine.  

It is as if some switch is being turned off and one without my knowing
what it is.  I have tried exiting Splus and restarting, opening a
new plotting window via graphsheet(), etc.  These do not work to fix
the problem, but eventually it seems to work again (for awhile). 

Any advice on this perplexing problem would be greatly appreciated. 

